{
  "id": 1386,
  "title": "梯度下降的直观原理",
  "meta_title": "梯度下降直观理解",
  "meta_description": "了解如何使用梯度迭代地趋向函数最小值的主要思路。",
  "content": "<p>梯度<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>指向成本函数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>增长最快的方向。然而，我们在机器学习 (machine learning)优化中的目标通常相反：我们希望<em>最小化</em>成本函数，以找到能提供最佳表现的模型参数 (parameter)<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>。那么，梯度如何能帮助我们下坡而不是上坡呢？</p>\n<p>想象你正站在一个山坡上，周围浓雾弥漫。你看不见谷底（最小值），但能感觉到脚下地面的坡度。要下山，最直观的做法是确定最陡峭的下降方向，然后朝那个方向迈出一步。你重复这个过程，不断检查坡度并向下迈步，希望能最终到达底部。</p>\n<p>梯度下降 (gradient descent)的工作原理与此非常相似。在我们的参数空间中，任何点<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>处可以测量的“坡度”由梯度<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>给出。由于梯度指向上坡（最陡峭的<em>上升</em>方向），因此最陡峭的<em>下降</em>方向就是其反方向：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>因此，梯度下降的核心思想是，从参数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>的某个初始猜测开始，然后通过朝着负梯度方向迈出小步来迭代更新它们。理想情况下，每一步都应使我们更接近成本函数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>最小的点。</p>\n<p>设想一个依赖于两个参数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>的简单成本函数。我们可以将此函数可视化为一个曲面，或者更常见地，使用等高线来表示，其中每条线代表成本相同的点。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-yvontt\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\"layout\": {\"title\": \"等高线图上的梯度下降路径\", \"xaxis\": {\"title\": \"参数 θ₁\", \"range\": [-4, 4]}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\": \"参数 θ₂\", \"range\": [-4, 4]}, \"width\": 600, \"height\": 500}, \"data\": [{\"type\": \"contour\", \"z\": [[25.0, 20.0, 17.0, 16.0, 17.0, 20.0, 25.0], [20.0, 15.0, 12.0, 11.0, 12.0, 15.0, 20.0], [17.0, 12.0, 9.0, 8.0, 9.0, 12.0, 17.0], [16.0, 11.0, 8.0, 7.0, 8.0, 11.0, 16.0], [17.0, 12.0, 9.0, 8.0, 9.0, 12.0, 17.0], [20.0, 15.0, 12.0, 11.0, 12.0, 15.0, 20.0], [25.0, 20.0, 17.0, 16.0, 17.0, 20.0, 25.0]], \"x\": [-3, -2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 3], \"y\": [-3, -2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 3], \"contours\": {\"coloring\": \"lines\"}, \"line\": {\"width\": 1, \"color\": \"#adb5bd\"}, \"colorscale\": [[0, \"#4263eb\"], [1, \"#ffc9c9\"]], \"showscale\": false}, {\"type\": \"scatter\", \"x\": [3, 2.4, 1.92, 1.54, 1.23], \"y\": [3, 2.4, 1.92, 1.54, 1.23], \"mode\": \"lines+markers\", \"line\": {\"color\": \"#f03e3e\", \"width\": 2}, \"marker\": {\"size\": 8, \"color\": \"#f03e3e\"}, \"name\": \"梯度下降路径\"}, {\"type\": \"scatter\", \"x\": [0], \"y\": [0], \"mode\": \"markers\", \"marker\": {\"size\": 10, \"color\": \"#37b24d\", \"symbol\": \"x\"}, \"name\": \"最小值\"}]}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 500px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-yvontt\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 500px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>一张显示成本函数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta_1, \\theta_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>等高线的等高线图。红线描绘了梯度下降所走的步长，从一个初始点开始，并朝着最小值（绿色“x”）移动，始终垂直于等高线（即沿着负梯度的方向）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>每一步都包含两个部分：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>计算方向</strong>：在当前的参数值处找到负梯度<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。这告诉我们最陡峭的下降方向。</li>\n<li><strong>迈出一步</strong>：通过在该方向上移动一定距离来更新参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每次迭代中迈出步长的大小是一个重要因素。如果步长太大，我们可能会越过最小值并出现不规则的震荡，甚至可能发散。如果步长太小，算法可能需要很长时间才能达到最小值。这个步长由一个称为<em>学习率</em>的参数控制，我们很快将详细讨论它。</p>\n<p>本质上，梯度下降提供了一种自动化的方式，来沿着成本函数的“山坡”走下去。通过重复计算局部坡度（梯度）并朝着向下方向迈出一步，它在参数空间中移动以找到使成本<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>最小的值<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>，从而优化机器学习模型。</p>",
